                      (   unit_tests.asm):01931         ; intermediate-check reasoning as TSTTOR, applied to the pair -
                      (   unit_tests.asm):01932         ; confirms both cells genuinely left the data stack before
                      (   unit_tests.asm):01933         ; verifying the round trip.
