                      (   unit_tests.asm):01989         ; TSTRFETCH, applied to the pair: moves x1,x2 to the return
                      (   unit_tests.asm):01990         ; stack via 2>R, peeks via 2R@ (verifying both cells, correctly
                      (   unit_tests.asm):01991         ; ordered), then retrieves the originals via 2R> (verifying 2R@
