                      (   unit_tests.asm):07475         ; TSTCOLON - unit test for : and ; together. Compiles
                      (   unit_tests.asm):07476         ; ": TESTWD 111 ;" into scratch (COLON parses the name, builds
                      (   unit_tests.asm):07477         ; a smudged header, sets CSP to the current U as the control-
                      (   unit_tests.asm):07478         ; flow balance baseline, sets STATE compiling; a literal 111 is
                      (   unit_tests.asm):07479         ; compiled; SEMI compiles the closing RTS, checks the CSP
                      (   unit_tests.asm):07480         ; balance, un-smudges the header, restores STATE) - then
                      (   unit_tests.asm):07481         ; executes the result and verifies it pushes 111. Also verifies
                      (   unit_tests.asm):07482         ; the header's own SMUDGE bit is correctly clear after SEMI -
                      (   unit_tests.asm):07483         ; not just that execution happened to work.
