                      (   unit_tests.asm):08105         ; TSTVALTO - unit test for VALUE and TO together. Compiles
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08106         ; "42 VALUE TESTWD", executes it (expect 42), then interprets
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08107         ; "99 TO TESTWD" directly (TO parses "TESTWD" via WORD+FIND,
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08108         ; needing LATEST still pointed at it - not restored until this
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08109         ; whole test finishes, unlike every earlier test in this
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08110         ; section), executes TESTWD again (expect 99). Explicitly forces
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08111         ; STATE=0 (interpreting) before calling TO, since its own
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08112         ; behavior genuinely differs by STATE (confirmed by reading its
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08113         ; code: TOIMMED's direct store path only runs when STATE=0) -
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08114         ; not left to chance.
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08115         ; ------------------------------------------------------------
