                      (   unit_tests.asm):08708         ; other test in this section), then simulates "something was
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08709         ; defined after the marker" by manually advancing the redirected
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08710         ; pointers further and pointing the real LATEST elsewhere,
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08711         ; executes the marker word, and verifies everything was restored
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08712         ; to TSTCBUF/TSTDBUF/TSTVBUF directly - the state BEFORE the
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08713         ; marker word itself was created, not the state right after.
