                      (   unit_tests.asm):08962         ; TSTIMMED - unit test for IMMEDIATE. Builds a fake header (LEN/
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08963         ; FL=3, no flags), points LATEST at it, calls IMMEDIATE, and
                      (   unit_tests.asm):08964         ; verifies the header's own LEN/FL byte now has bit 7 set -
