                      (   unit_tests.asm):10605         ; C, appends a byte (verified the same way), ALLOT reserves then
                      (   unit_tests.asm):10606         ; releases bytes (confirming both directions work, matching
                      (   unit_tests.asm):10607         ; "reserve (or release, if negative)"), and a final HERE
