                      (   unit_tests.asm):13348         ; HOLD itself prepends, the two behaviors combine to preserve
                      (   unit_tests.asm):13349         ; the original forward order in the pictured buffer, matching
                      (   unit_tests.asm):13350         ; its own documented "depends on HOLD's exact decrement-by-one
                      (   unit_tests.asm):13351         ; behavior".
