                      (   unit_tests.asm):14958         ; matching its own documented "follows SOURCE... operates
                      (   unit_tests.asm):14959         ; correctly inside EVALUATE" - this test's own redirect of
                      (   unit_tests.asm):14960         ; SRCLEN specifically, rather than relying on the real terminal
                      (   unit_tests.asm):14961         ; input buffer's own length, is what actually exercises that.
