                      (   unit_tests.asm):15729         ; TSTTOOLS - tools word set tests (glossary section 3.18, 3
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15730         ; words). WORDS depends directly on LATEST (confirmed via its
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15731         ; own code) - redirected for this test, applying the same
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15732         ; lesson section 3.17's own TSTEVALUATE surfaced. DUMP dumps a
