                      (   unit_tests.asm):15736         ; column's blanking for the unused portion, not just the real
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15737         ; data. .S prints the entire real data stack, including whatever
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15738         ; the calling chain already left there - unlike every other test
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15739         ; in this session, the full output can't be predicted in
                      (   unit_tests.asm):15740         ; advance, so this section's own test verifies the core,
