E5FA DC76             (    forth6809.asm):03128                   LDD   UDLO
E5FC 3606             (    forth6809.asm):03129                   PSHU  D
E5FE CCFFFF           (    forth6809.asm):03130                   LDD   #-1
E601 3606             (    forth6809.asm):03131                   PSHU  D
