E8BE 39               (    forth6809.asm):03562                  RTS              ; on the limit (what's really at 4,S unshifted)
                      (    forth6809.asm):03563                                   ; instead of the index. The pair served no
                      (    forth6809.asm):03564                                   ; purpose (nothing needed offset 0 for anything
                      (    forth6809.asm):03565                                   ; here) - removed, so 2,S directly and
                      (    forth6809.asm):03566                                   ; correctly targets the index DOSETUP pushed
