                      (    forth6809.asm):03599                                   ; feeds LDD ,X/LEAX D,X afterward). Removed,
                      (    forth6809.asm):03600                                   ; per the parallel 68000 port's observation,
                      (    forth6809.asm):03601                                   ; confirmed by inspection.
