                      (    forth6809.asm):06798                                      ; memory map shifts again (it has
                      (    forth6809.asm):06799                                      ; repeatedly this session). RSTACK's own
                      (    forth6809.asm):06800                                      ; comment confirms the occupied range is
                      (    forth6809.asm):06801                                      ; $BD00-RSTACK (768 bytes currently) -
                      (    forth6809.asm):06802                                      ; DSTACK+1 is $BD00 exactly (the two
                      (    forth6809.asm):06803                                      ; regions are contiguous, per RSTACK's
                      (    forth6809.asm):06804                                      ; and DSTACK's own comments). Since
                      (    forth6809.asm):06805                                      ; RSTACK-(DSTACK+1)+1 simplifies to
                      (    forth6809.asm):06806                                      ; RSTACK-DSTACK (the +1/-1 cancel), the
